WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.300
Select a game or application window. The local preview confirms the source.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:15.300
Advanced settings expose output, resolution, frame rate, audio and codec
controls.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.900
